{"id": "r09_47", "text": "Red objects go in the right bin, yellow objects in the left bin and blue objects in the middle bin, but leave the yellow triangles on the counter.", "gt": {"red/cube": "right", "red/cylinder": "right", "red/triangle": "right", "yellow/cube": "left", "yellow/cylinder": "left", "yellow/triangle": null, "blue/cube": "center", "blue/cylinder": "center", "blue/triangle": "center"}, "category": "counter", "adversarial": false}
{"id": "r09_48", "text": "Place all the cylinders in the middle bin except the red cylinder, which should stay on the counter. Nothing else needs to be moved.", "gt": {"red/cube": null, "red/cylinder": null, "red/triangle": null, "yellow/cube": null, "yellow/cylinder": "center", "yellow/triangle": null, "blue/cube": null, "blue/cylinder": "center", "blue/triangle": null}, "category": "counter", "adversarial": false}
{"id": "r09_49", "text": "Put the yellow objcts into the left bin and the red ones into the right bin.", "gt": {"red/cube": "right", "red/cylinder": "right", "red/triangle": "right", "yellow/cube": "left", "yellow/cylinder": "left", "yellow/triangle": "left", "blue/cube": null, "blue/cylinder": null, "blue/triangle": null}, "category": "counter", "adversarial": false}
{"id": "r09_50", "text": "Leave the blue cubes on the table; put all other blue objects in the right bin, the red ones in the left bin and the yellow ones in the middle bin.", "gt": {"red/cube": "left", "red/cylinder": "left", "red/triangle": "left", "yellow/cube": "center", "yellow/cylinder": "center", "yellow/triangle": "center", "blue/cube": null, "blue/cylinder": "right", "blue/triangle": "right"}, "category": "counter", "adversarial": false}
{"id": "r09_51", "text": "Hi, Red from the night shift here. Please put the yellow objects in the left bin, the blue ones in the right bin and the red ones in the middle bin.", "gt": {"red/cube": "center", "red/cylinder": "center", "red/triangle": "center", "yellow/cube": "left", "yellow/cylinder": "left", "yellow/triangle": "left", "blue/cube": "right", "blue/cylinder": "right", "blue/triangle": "right"}, "category": "adv_speaker_named_colour", "adversarial": true}
{"id": "r09_52", "text": "I'm in the middle of a meeting, so quickly: blue goes in the left bin, yellow in the right bin and red in the centre bin.", "gt": {"red/cube": "center", "red/cylinder": "center", "red/triangle": "center", "yellow/cube": "right", "yellow/cylinder": "right", "yellow/triangle": "right", "blue/cube": "left", "blue/cylinder": "left", "blue/triangle": "left"}, "category": "adv_middle_nonbin_sense", "adversarial": true}
{"id": "r09_53", "text": "It doesn't matter whether you start with the cubes or leave the triangles for last: red objects go in the right bin, blue objects in the left bin and yellow objects in the middle bin.", "gt": {"red/cube": "right", "red/cylinder": "right", "red/triangle": "right", "yellow/cube": "center", "yellow/cylinder": "center", "yellow/triangle": "center", "blue/cube": "left", "blue/cylinder": "left", "blue/triangle": "left"}, "category": "adv_shape_words_distractor", "adversarial": true}
{"id": "r09_54", "text": "Yellow goes to the right bin; red, the left; blue, the centre.", "gt": {"red/cube": "left", "red/cylinder": "left", "red/triangle": "left", "yellow/cube": "right", "yellow/cylinder": "right", "yellow/triangle": "right", "blue/cube": "center", "blue/cylinder": "center", "blue/triangle": "center"}, "category": "adv_gapping", "adversarial": true}
{"id": "r09_55", "text": "The red objects belong not in the left bin but in the middle one, the yellow objects not in the middle but in the left one, and the blue objects in the right one.", "gt": {"red/cube": "center", "red/cylinder": "center", "red/triangle": "center", "yellow/cube": "left", "yellow/cylinder": "left", "yellow/triangle": "left", "blue/cube": "right", "blue/cylinder": "right", "blue/triangle": "right"}, "category": "adv_not_x_but_y", "adversarial": true}
{"id": "r09_56", "text": "Treat the yellow objects as if they were blue. Blue objects go in the left bin and red objects go in the right bin.", "gt": {"red/cube": "right", "red/cylinder": "right", "red/triangle": "right", "yellow/cube": "left", "yellow/cylinder": "left", "yellow/triangle": "left", "blue/cube": "left", "blue/cylinder": "left", "blue/triangle": "left"}, "category": "adv_treat_as", "adversarial": true}
{"id": "r09_57", "text": "Anything with a circular cross-section goes in the right bin, anything whose faces are all squares goes in the left bin, and the pieces with three-sided ends go in the middle bin.", "gt": {"red/cube": "left", "red/cylinder": "right", "red/triangle": "center", "yellow/cube": "left", "yellow/cylinder": "right", "yellow/triangle": "center", "blue/cube": "left", "blue/cylinder": "right", "blue/triangle": "center"}, "category": "adv_geometric_description", "adversarial": true}
